sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant HTTP as HTTP Server<br/>8080/TCP FastAPI
    participant GRPC as gRPC Server<br/>8085/TCP
    participant Predict as GlobalPredictServicer
    participant Train as GlobalTrainServicer
    participant MM as ModelManager<br/>(in-process cache)
    participant Module as Module.run()<br/>(ML model)
    participant MMesh as ModelMesh Controller<br/>Unix socket
    participant MRS as ModelRuntimeServicer
    participant FS as Local Filesystem

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over Client,Module: Flow 1: HTTP Inference
        Client->>HTTP: POST /api/v1/task/{task_name}<br/>JSON or multipart/form-data<br/>TLS optional
        HTTP->>Predict: Route to servicer<br/>(in-process)
        Predict->>MM: retrieve_model(model_id)
        MM-->>Predict: Loaded model reference
        Predict->>Module: module.run(input)<br/>(in-process)
        Module-->>Predict: Prediction result
        Predict-->>HTTP: Response data object
        HTTP-->>Client: JSON response<br/>(or SSE stream for streaming)
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over Client,Module: Flow 2: gRPC Inference
        Client->>GRPC: Predict RPC<br/>gRPC/TLS/mTLS
        GRPC->>Predict: CaikitRuntimeServerWrapper<br/>(interceptor chain)
        Predict->>MM: retrieve_model(model_id)
        MM-->>Predict: Loaded model reference
        Predict->>Module: module.run(input)<br/>(in-process)
        Module-->>Predict: Prediction result
        Predict-->>GRPC: Protobuf response
        GRPC-->>Client: gRPC response<br/>(unary or server-stream)
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note over MMesh,FS: Flow 3: ModelMesh Integration
        MMesh->>MRS: loadModel(model_id, model_path)<br/>gRPC/Unix socket/plaintext
        MRS->>MM: load_model(model_id)
        MM->>FS: Read model artifacts
        FS-->>MM: Model files
        MM-->>MRS: Model loaded (size info)
        MRS-->>MMesh: LoadModelResponse<br/>(sizeInBytes)
    end

    rect rgb(255, 230, 245)
        Note over Client,FS: Flow 4: Training Job
        Client->>GRPC: Train RPC<br/>gRPC/8085 or HTTP/8080
        GRPC->>Train: Route to GlobalTrainServicer
        Train->>MM: train(module, params)<br/>(async future)
        MM->>Module: Module.train(data)
        Module->>FS: Write trained model<br/>(output directory)
        FS-->>Module: Model saved
        Module-->>Train: Training complete
        Train-->>GRPC: Training status response
        GRPC-->>Client: Training ID + status
    end
